Selects the model loaded for Effect 1 ;
NOTE: The six values that correspond to the category that is currently in use with
Effect 2 will not perform any action for Effect 1 ; 
0 - 5 = Delay models ;
6 - 11 = Modulation models ;
12 - 17 = Pitch / Filter models ;
18 - 23 = Reverb models ;

Selects the model loaded for Effect 2 ;
NOTE: The six values that correspond to the category that is currently in use with
Effect 1 will not perform any action for Effect 2 ; 
0 - 5 = Delay models ;
6 - 11 = Modulation models ;
12 - 17 = Pitch / Filter models ;
18 - 23 = Reverb models ;

Controls position of Effect 2, before (Pre) the Amp Voicing or after (Post) ;
0 - 63 = Pre ;
64 - 127 = Post ;

